  "worked_solution": "Multiplying each row in the first matrix by each column in the second, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 6 \\\\ 8 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}1\\cdot 1+6\\cdot 2 & 1\\cdot 0+6\\cdot (-5) \\\\ 8\\cdot 1+(-3)\\cdot 2 & 8\\cdot 0+(-3)\\cdot (-5)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1+12 & 0+(-30) \\\\ 8+(-6) & 0+15\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}13 & -30 \\\\ 2 & 15\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
